						<effect>You empower a vial of holy water to deal additional damage to undead creatures. You can empower 1 vials of holy water. When thrown at an undead creature, the affected vial of holy water deals 2 points of bonus damage on a direct hit, and half that amount of to creatures caught in the splash area. This additional damage is positive energy damage, and has no effect on living creatures.</effect>
